A '''Sea Witch''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] after reaching {{Skill|Fishing|7}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Sea Witch''' can be caught on the [[Hub Island]] and most other non-fishing islands. It requires {{skill|fishing|VII}} or higher to be caught.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for a '''Sea Witch''' is {{Green|700}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|16.29%|1|6.14|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

