== Trivia ==
*The '''Sea Witch''' is a [[Mob]] that used to be very similar to the [[Night Squid]] in the fact that it only spawns while [[Fishing]] at a certain time of day while using a certain kind of [[Bait]].
**The bait and time requirements have been removed as of the [[Changelog/2020/September 8|0.9]] update.

